{
  "id": "1SA.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "Samuel 1 12",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Komwachin Samuel saisere Israelik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Samuel Israel tugul, Ogeero, kiagas ng’alekwok eng’ tuguk tugul che kiomwawa, ak kiacheng’wok laitoriat ne boiywok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ogeero, wendoti laitoriat eng’ taing’wong’: ak koaositu, ak koabunji kalwalek; ak ogeero, mi werikyuk kobotok: ak kiawendote eng’ taing’wong’ koboch ming’inatennyu agoi betuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami yu: omwa ng’olyo eng’ taitab Jehovah, ne ongenja, ak eng’ taitab nenyi ne kigiil: kiarebe ng’o tennyi? Anan kiarebe ng’o sigiriennyi? Anan kiaberber ng’o? Kiaus ng’o? Anan kianam eng’ eutab ng’o tuguk che kigoigoisie, si atuge konyekyuk? Si aweekwok tuguchoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile, Ma iberberech, anan iusech, anan inam eng’ eutab chi kiy age tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji ichek, Baoriat Jehovah agobo okwek, ak baoriat eng’ betuni nenyi ne kigiil, kole, ma onyoru kiy eng’ eunnyu. Ak kile, Baoriat inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwachi Samuel bik kolenji, Jehovah ne kileweni Musa ak Aron, ak ko ine ne kiimutu kwanisiekwok kotogos eng’ emetab Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otononse anyun nguno, si kobiit ateeiywok eng’ taitab Jehovah agobo boisionik tugul che bo imanda che bo Jehovah, che kiyaiywok ak kwanisiekwok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye kingonyo Jakobo Misri, ak korirji kwanisiekwok Jehovah, koyok anyun Jehovah Musa ak Aron, che kiimong’ kwanisiekwok eng’ Misri, ak kogochi komeny olito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiutie Jehovah Kamuktaindenywa, ak kialdochi ichek eutab Sisera, kiptaiyatab lugetab Hasor, ak kialdochi eutab Pilistik, ak eutab laitoriatab Moab, ak kibargei ak ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kirirji Jehovah kolenji, Kigeyai tengekto, amu kigebagakte Jehovah, ak keot Baalik ak Astarot: ago soruech nguno eng’ eutab bunikyok, si keotin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiiyok Jehovah Jeru-baal, ak Bedan, ak Jepta, ak Samuel, ak kosoruok eng’ eunekab bunikwok eng’ komosta age tugul, ak kiomeng’isie eng’ kalyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer Nahas laitoriab lagokab Amon, konyo obarge, olenja, Achicha, boiywech laitoriat: ago ki laitoriandeng’wong’ Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeer anyun laitoriat ne kiolewen, ne kiosom: ak ogeero, kagonde Jehovah laitoriat koboiywok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngot oiywei Jehovah, ak oot inendet, ak ogas it kutinnyi, amobistoe ng’atutietab Jehovah, ak ngot oegu okwek ak laitoriat agine ne koboiywok, kasubikab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’, komieitu anyun: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ago ngot ko mogas it kutitab Jehovah, ago ngot obistoe ng’atutietab Jehovah, konyalilok eutab Jehovah anyun, ko u ye kiinyalil kwanisiekwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otononse anyun si ogeer kii o, ne machei koyai Jehovah ogeere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tos ma betusiekab kesisietab nganok rani? Aguure Jehovah si koyok tulet ak ropta; si onai ak ogeer ole o tengektang’wong’, ne kioyai eng’ taitab Jehovah, amu kiosomjige laitoriat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koguur anyun Samuel Jehovah; ak kiiyok Jehovah betunoto tulet ak ropta: ak kiiywei bik tugul Jehovah ak Samuel mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji bik tugul Samuel, Saiywech achek otwogiguk Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’, si ma kibegu: amu kogetesyi tengekwogikyok tugul yaitioni, kesomjige laitoriat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Samuel bik, Amoiywei: kioyai iman yaitioni tugul: ago amomaste obagach osub Jehovah, ago oot Jehovah eng’ mugulelwekwok tugul; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amomaste osub tugukab buch che maimuchi kotoret kiy anan kosor, amu buch. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu mabagaktoi Jehovah bikyik amu kainennyi ne o: amu kicham Jehovah koyaak oegu bikyik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ingolooit eng’ ane, amayachi Jehovah tengek, abagakte asaiywok: ago anetok eng’ oret ne mie ne nyolu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oiywei Jehovah kityo, ak oot inendet eng’ imanit eng’ mugulelwekwok tugul: ak obwat ole te tuguk che eechen che kigoyaiywok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ngot ko ta oyai yaitiet, kigeswok, okwek ak laitoriandeng’wong’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
